      "speaker_id": "cen_ya",
      "expression": "curious",
      "outfit": "child_warm_clothes",
      "text": "姨，今天你坐我旁边吃吗？锅点着以后会回来吗？如果有人回不来，他的饭盒怎么办？",
      "next": "cya_choice_01"
    },
    {
      "id": "cya_choice_01",
      "type": "choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "cya_choice_fourth_chopstick",
          "text": "给她留一双第四双筷子，并把大人何时回家、谁来照看和饭盒放在哪里说清楚，不用空话哄她。",
          "next": "cya_line_02",
          "effects": [
            {"type": "relation_delta", "character_id": "cen_ya", "stat": "trust", "delta": 2},
            {"type": "set_flag", "flag": "cen_ya_fourth_chopstick_recorded", "value": true}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cya_choice_draw_route",
          "text": "请她用画纸画出锅、红灯和安全路线，交给大人核对，不让孩子承担撤离决定，只让她知道自己该去哪里找照护者。",
          "next": "cya_line_02",
          "effects": [
            {"type": "relation_delta", "character_id": "cen_ya", "stat": "respect", "delta": 1},
            {"type": "set_flag", "flag": "cen_ya_draw_route_recorded", "value": true}
